{
  "message": "I can help submit a credit limit increase for your Gold Rewards Card. To proceed I need to verify your identity (we must confirm any 2 of: date of birth in MM/DD/YYYY, email, phone number, or address). Please tell me: 1) which 2 fields you’ll provide and their exact values, 2) whether you are the account owner or an authorized account manager, and 3) the exact increase you want (either the dollar amount to add, e.g., $5,000, or the new total limit you’re requesting).\n\nAfter verification I will submit the request and check eligibility (account age, cooldown, utilization). If you’d prefer, I can instead walk you through submitting the request in the app — tell me which you prefer."
}

{
  "message": "Thanks — I can submit this for you. I need one more piece of information to look up your account so I can verify the DOB (01/25/1986) and phone (347-555-0387): please provide your full name exactly as it appears on your Rho-Bank account (case sensitive), or alternatively your user ID or account email. Once you provide that I will verify those two fields, log the verification, and then submit a $2,500 credit limit increase request for your Gold Rewards Card. Do you confirm you want me to proceed once I have your name/user ID/email?"
}

